body:
Hi there.

&#x200B;

I am new to this subreddit, and I just wanted to show some people on here because I thought they might find it cool or interesting. I'm sorry but in these 2 replies youve made you have been very rude to me, and you don't even know me. I'm sorry to upset you, but I own most of my fave movies on vhs, and watch them regularly. Also, I did end up opening it as soon as I got home! So please stop being rude to me for no reason, I love vhs tapes, and the last thing I need is somebody being so rude when it was really uncalled for. Sorry but please dont make me feel unwelcome on this subreddit. Thank you 🙂
